<title>JAPAN: Japan to act against excessive currency moves - MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan to act against excessive currency moves - MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan will deal decisively and &quot;in a timely manner&quot; with any excessive currency movements, Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In a speech to bank executives, Mitsuzuka said the yen's recent fall against the dollar had been excessive.</p>
</text>
